            <note corresp="#d489-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d489-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated for information to Amman, Baghdad, Beirut, Cairo, Damascus, Jerusalem,
                    Paris, London, and Jidda.</p>
            </note>
